7AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3l/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Positional Work Log bullets in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli: lex unnumbered first-level bullets (all or none), assign them [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in order to the close's worked tasks (lexically when `<N>`/`*<P>` is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed, against the running session otherwise), make [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`CloseLogEntry.index` optional with a positional origin, report resolved[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]indices in `bob capture` JSON, add the new diagnostics, and update help,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture decoding, fixtures, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode an absent `log[].index` as nil, add real-bob parse and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview fixtures plus tests for unnumbered bullets, and rewrite the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README's Work Log bullet contract and syntax text; no grammar logic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]moves into Swift.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3l","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3l.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ad23de41a9c5217e5c524099ee23c12e","started_at":"2026-10-02T19:18:17.937910+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3l","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3l.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-3l.2","bbugyi200